msgid "The lab is ready. Tap the highlighted flask button (top) to open the technology tree."
msgstr "The lab is ready. Tap the highlighted flask button (top) to open the technology tree."

msgid "The lab is ready. Click RESEARCH NEW TECHNOLOGIES (highlighted) to open the technology tree."
msgstr "The lab is ready. Click RESEARCH NEW TECHNOLOGIES (highlighted) to open the technology tree."

msgid "Pick a technology in the tree and start it. Research costs credits and takes time; its effect works for all your units once it is done."
msgstr "Pick a technology in the tree and start it. Research costs credits and takes time; its effect works for all your units once it is done."

msgid "You know the basics now. Train an army, research upgrades and destroy the enemy base. The highlighted clipboard button (top) shows the goals of the mission.\nGood luck, Commander!"
msgstr "You know the basics now. Train an army, research upgrades and destroy the enemy base. The highlighted clipboard button (top) shows the goals of the mission.\nGood luck, Commander!"

