msgid "This is your first mission. Would you like to take the tutorial? It shows step by step how to control units, train soldiers and vehicles, build a base with its defenses and research technologies.\nFor the tutorial, advanced technologies are unlocked for you."
msgstr "This is your first mission. Would you like to take the tutorial? It shows step by step how to control units, train soldiers and vehicles, build a base with its defenses and research technologies.\nFor the tutorial, advanced technologies are unlocked for you."

msgid "Your mission: build up your base, train an army and destroy the enemy base.\nThe highlighted part of the screen is what the current step is about; the rest of the interface waits until the step is done. Advanced technologies are unlocked and you get extra credits for the lessons. The enemy will not attack while the tutorial runs."
msgstr "Your mission: build up your base, train an army and destroy the enemy base.\nThe highlighted part of the screen is what the current step is about; the rest of the interface waits until the step is done. Advanced technologies are unlocked and you get extra credits for the lessons. The enemy will not attack while the tutorial runs."

msgid "Move the camera: drag one finger across the map, or hold a finger at an edge of the screen. Pinch with two fingers to zoom.\nA tap on the radar (highlighted) jumps there at once."
msgstr "Move the camera: drag one finger across the map, or hold a finger at an edge of the screen. Pinch with two fingers to zoom.\nA tap on the radar (highlighted) jumps there at once."

msgid "Move the camera: push the mouse against an edge of the screen, or hold W A S D or the arrow keys. The mouse wheel zooms.\nA click on the radar (highlighted) jumps there at once."
msgstr "Move the camera: push the mouse against an edge of the screen, or hold W A S D or the arrow keys. The mouse wheel zooms.\nA click on the radar (highlighted) jumps there at once."

msgid "Right-click the ground: the selected soldiers go there. Right-click an enemy to attack it.\nQ, then a click on the ground: attack-move, they fight every enemy on their way."
msgstr "Right-click the ground: the selected soldiers go there. Right-click an enemy to attack it.\nQ, then a click on the ground: attack-move, they fight every enemy on their way."

msgid "Now let's build. The research lab develops new technologies. Open the building cards with the build button (bottom right) and tap the lab card (highlighted). The price is shown on the card."
msgstr "Now let's build. The research lab develops new technologies. Open the building cards with the build button (bottom right) and tap the lab card (highlighted). The price is shown on the card."

msgid "Now let's build. The research lab develops new technologies. Open the BUILD tab on the sidebar and click the lab card (highlighted). The price is shown on the card."
msgstr "Now let's build. The research lab develops new technologies. Open the BUILD tab on the sidebar and click the lab card (highlighted). The price is shown on the card."

msgid "Every building takes power, and the factory you build next takes a lot. Build a power plant first: tap its card (highlighted)."
msgstr "Every building takes power, and the factory you build next takes a lot. Build a power plant first: tap its card (highlighted)."

