msgstr "The factory is ready. Click your factory (highlighted) to select it."

msgid "Tap the highlighted card to build a Coyote: a fast light vehicle with a machine gun, good for scouting and for hunting infantry."
msgstr "Tap the highlighted card to build a Coyote: a fast light vehicle with a machine gun, good for scouting and for hunting infantry."

