msgid "Walls are laid one segment at a time: tap a free spot, then tap the segment again (or the highlighted confirm button) to lay it. Lay 3 segments side by side."
msgstr "Walls are laid one segment at a time: tap a free spot, then tap the segment again (or the highlighted confirm button) to lay it. Lay 3 segments side by side."

msgid "Walls are laid one segment at a time: click 3 free spots side by side next to your base. The wall mode stays on until you right-click."
msgstr "Walls are laid one segment at a time: click 3 free spots side by side next to your base. The wall mode stays on until you right-click."

msgid "A guard tower fires at enemies from afar. If the wall is still being laid, end it with the highlighted cancel button, then tap the tower card (highlighted)."
msgstr "A guard tower fires at enemies from afar. If the wall is still being laid, end it with the highlighted cancel button, then tap the tower card (highlighted)."

